I do, however have a very minor suggestion to do with ALL portals:



When you step on a portal and get transported, step one square off it,
then immediately back on to it. Then, when you get back to where you
came from, step one step off the transporter, then back onto it. 

Do this, (perhaps once more is necessary) and both portals become
permanently visible, hence easy to find.

[Does not apply to the end game, because you never want to go
backwards.]

